  "result": "Perfect! All 98 tests pass. Added tier-based discounts to the system.\n\n**Changes made:**\n\n1. **src/customers.js** \u2014 Added and exported `TIER_DISCOUNTS`:\n   - gold: 5%\n   - silver: 2.5%\n   - standard: 0%\n\n2. **src/invoices.js** \u2014 Updated `createInvoice` and `addLine`:\n   - When a line has no `discountPercent`, automatically apply the customer's tier discount\n   - When a line has an explicit `discountPercent` (even if 0), that always takes precedence\n   - Logic: `lineDiscountPercent = line.discountPercent ?? TIER_DISCOUNTS[customer.tier]`\n\n3. **Updated existing tests** \u2014 Fixed tests that were written before tier discounts to reflect the new automatic discounts\n\n4. **Added new tests** \u2014 8 new tests covering:\n   - \u2713 Tier discounts applied correctly for each tier (gold, silver, standard)\n   - \u2713 User-provided discountPercent overrides tier discount\n   - \u2713 Even 0% discount overrides tier discount\n   - \u2713 addLine applies tier discount for new lines\n   - \u2713 Different customers get different tier discounts\n\nKey behavior:\n- Every line without an explicit discount gets its customer's tier discount\n- Explicit discounts always win (even 0 overrides the tier discount)\n- Tier discounts are centralized in one place for easy updates\n\nAll 98 tests pass.",
